  m_Name: Exporter Redmont
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.TrueEncounterData
  vendorName: Exporter Redmont
  offerText: That massive, noisy exotic birdcage is taking up half your parlor. Sell
    the beast to my overseas client. I will pay top dollar, though your home will
    be awfully quiet.
  acceptResultText: Redmont's crew wheels the giant cage out. You count your thick
    stack of bills in the newly opened space, but the deafening silence breaks your
    heart.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to sell your companion. The giant cage continues to
    stubbornly dominate the room.
  acceptedDelayedText: 
  rejectedDelayedText: The exotic bird breaks the cage lock, trashes your room, and
    viciously pecks your face before escaping out the window! You are left bleeding
    in a ruined room.
